    "heading": "Always-Prepared Spells",
    "lineStart": 7190,
    "lineEnd": 7192
  },
  "section": "7.4",
  "rulesText": "Certain features might give you a spell that you always have prepared. If you also have a list of prepared spells that you can change, a spell that you always have prepared doesn't count against the number of spells on that list."
}
